`crates/ui` contains code and design that was ported or closely adapted from two
upstream projects. Both licences permit it; both require attribution, and
Apache-2.0 §4(b) additionally requires that modified files carry prominent
notices **stating that they were changed**. Every file in `crates/ui` that owes
anything to either project carries a `# Provenance` section in its module header
naming the upstream project, the upstream file, and what was changed. This
NOTICE is the index of those, not a substitute for them.

